@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+Use case: product-mockup
+Asset type: landscape 1536x1024 portfolio section and printed design-system specimen
+Input images: Image 1 Central Belleza real public landing, Image 2 NutriPlan real dashboard, Image 3 Casa Roca real site screenshot, Image 4 ETERIA real site visual as an ivory linen texture reference, Image 5 NutriPlan real landing. Preserve authentic actual source interface details wherever applicable; no fake interface for ETERIA or AOHYS.
+Primary request: A luxury type-foundry specimen titled exactly “Espécimen de sistema”, built around exactly five products in an exceptionally balanced three-over-two modular composition with a precise central axis. Use five large, distinct solid palette fields and confident captions. Each plate shows a real product artifact or an intact authentic interface screenshot. This should feel designed by an award-winning editorial studio, never like a dashboard.
